{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量本地推-本地推\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量本地推\"],\"capability_summary\":\"本接口为全量更新本地推单元，每次更新会对所有参数进行调整，若希望进行局部更新，请先通过获取单元列表接口前置获取单元的详情信息再进行更新。配合使用的接口有获取Access token、获取本地推投放可用抖音号、获取图文素材等\",\"id\":\"local.promotion.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/local/promotion/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1808440848912411\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"若要进行局部更新，需要先获取单元详情信息\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取单元列表\"},{\"id\":\"\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"用于获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"用于获取可传入的抖音号ID\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取本地推投放可用抖音号\"},{\"id\":\"\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"用于获取图文素材carousel_id\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取图文素材\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1808440848912411\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"更新单元\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IryLM%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Col%20data-id%3D%5C%22o9d5df12-f3adU1MX%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-A2JWeRax%5C%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%BA%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%23f5222d%3B%5C%22%3E%E5%85%A8%E9%87%8F%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%3C%2Fspan%3E%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E4%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%EF%BC%8C%E8%8B%A5%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E5%85%88%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%8D%95%E5%85%83%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%8D%95%E5%85%83%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%A6%E6%83%85%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%86%8D%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Fol%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-f3adU1MX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-A2JWeRax\">本接口为<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">全量更新</span>，每次更新会对所有参数进行调整，若希望进行局部更新，请先通过获取单元列表接口前置获取单元的详情信息再进行更新</li></ol></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201808142535011459%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ODL9CYTO\" id=\"h346b9f0-ODL9CYTO\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-ok3gKrGr\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/local/promotion/update/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/local/promotion/update/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1808440848912411\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-aSDQ2FUa\" id=\"h346b9f0-aSDQ2FUa\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-f9GAPOq6\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-elEXJ92f\" id=\"h346b9f0-elEXJ92f\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2baIW1dx\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6nGcPea0\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-8ePRSoX4\" id=\"h346b9f0-8ePRSoX4\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">local_account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sCyy5mKA\">本地推投放账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">promotion_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nXoVdvGY\">单元ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iFdaKx8E\">单元名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-boBhzGxl\">用于投放的抖音号ID</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-DO5sZCY4\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UqILtqkT\">仅当存在素材库视频或本地上传视频时，该字段有意义</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-CljDKzHb\">原项目未选择抖音号id时支持传入，若项目已选择抖音号id，不支持更新修改</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-A8MGavQm\">可通过<span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">【获取本地推投放可用抖音号】</span> 接口获取抖音号ID</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qEaj5UNL\">仅交易场景支持传入，当<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">local_delivery_scene =</span><code>EXTERNAL</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"> 获取线索时，不支持传入。</span></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_hp_visibility</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">主页视频是否可见，允许值：<ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ZgWDZRFk\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nR4OYWEy\"><code>ALWAYS_VISIBLE</code> 主页始终可见</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LDHmW0EY\"><code>HIDE_VIDEO_ON_HP</code> 仅单次展示可见</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-cM5SZtNP\">local_delivery_scene=<code>CONTENT_HEAT</code> 线上互动 &amp; <code>PRODUCT_PAY</code>时支持传入</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-AqgLmO6c\">注意：仅针对素材库和本地上传视频生效</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">customer_material_list</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HWBnCJgI\">视频素材信息</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Dan8Q4c1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FR4Gl1JO\">当营销场景为直播间，且直播素材类型为直播间画面（即live_material_type=<code>LIVE</code>）时，视频素材不生效，不支持传入</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ak58orhq\">当营销场景为短视频，且未开启团购卡时，不支持清空视频素材</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-xC0YxaJ6\">注意：该模块为全量更新，需传入单元要投放的所有视频素材，传入空数组时会清空单元原来选择的视频，传空或不传则不会更新。</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">image_mode</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">素材类型，可选值:<ul data-id=\"u738a58b-3o3XbD7Y\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9Juv2SM2\"><code>IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO</code> 横版视频</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iHONxI2N\"><code>IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO_VERTICAL</code> 竖版视频</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">title_material</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-I9PnAYFt\">标题素材</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-g7Jo12bK\"></ol><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-akp42D1T\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KxyFnywm\">仅针对素材库视频生效且必填，即传入video_id时，该字段生效且必填</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rULDJkwF\">当传入item_id时，以抖音主页视频的标题为主，该字段不生效</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">title</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-feqyeJX8\">标题，填写要求：字符限制[5,55]<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">（两个英文字符占1个字）</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_material</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AsLmPf3Y\">视频素材</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fqVnhFck\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">视频ID</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cover_web_uri</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">封面图片URI</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_item_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-X3wn3klK\">抖音短视频ID，投放抖音主页视频时传入</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Hv7P8jYw\">注意：如果视频为抖音主页视频，则该字段必填</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-f3gELa6F\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">如果和video_id同时传，以aweme_item_id为准</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">procedural_material</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-06eM5O1q\">线索单元素材列表</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-MGK7U6lO\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ncTM0ZtA\">当且仅当local_delivery_scene=<code>EXTERNAL</code>时，支持传入</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\